<title>USA: Alteon Inc Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Alteon Inc Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>RAMSEY, N.J. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							 March 31,</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p> Investment Income				 $444	    $608</p>
<p> Net Loss					 (5,778)	 (2,428)</p>
<p> Net Loss Per Share			    (0.37)	  (0.16)</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding	    15,708,158    15,519,638</p>
<p>		(Dollars in Thousands Except Per Share Amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net loss for the first quarter of 1997 increased in these periods primarily as a result of increased research and development expenses related to its assumption of the costs of the pivotal Phase III ACTION (A Clinical Trial In Overt Nephropathy) trials.</p>
</text>
